[[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891394\">1048B50</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the retaining bolts.</p><p>2. Remove the air shroud from the heat exchanger.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034151.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the condition of the shroud.</p><p>Tighten the shroud retaining bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2891394\">1048B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2892268\">7055B42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2891739\">4450B10</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]